    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">The interquartile range measures the spread of the middle 50% of the data. It is calculated as <em>IQR = Q3 - Q1</em>, where Q3 is the upper quartile and Q1 is the lower quartile. This shows how spread out the central data values are.</p>",
